<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's Kekkuti to buy own shares.</title>
<headline>Hungary's Kekkuti to buy own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian mineral water bottler and distributor Kekkuti Asvanyviz Rt announced on Thursday it had decided to buy own shares.</p>
<p>The company decided to buy shares up to a nominal 11.9 million forints which is equal to five percent of its issued share capital, Kekkuti said in a statement.</p>
<p>On the Budapest Stock Exchange Kekkuti shares closed at 1,150 forints, up 250, on Wednesday. -- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
